      "end": 3454.01,
      "text": "کسپ کا چیزم کرتے گناν؟"
    },
    {
      "id": 114,
      "start": 3455.01,
      "end": 3456.01,
      "text": "but I don't know what is going on here."
    },
    {
      "id": 115,
